      "UIX R1 changes source topology and information ownership; UIX R2 supplies the flat dark adaptive visual shell.",
      "Normal Media and Library surfaces no longer render phase labels, telemetry, worker bridge, runtime plans, privacy audit, or final-validation decks.",
      "Developer diagnostics remain available and are computed only when the diagnostics workspace is opened.",
